## Command rules
Use shell commands, sed, grep, jq, goku, and apply_patch only for Karabiner/Goku configuration work.
Do not rewrite the whole config unless the user explicitly asks.
Do not invent app bundle identifiers; inspect existing app conditions first when possible.
